sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User agent
  participant W as WASM client
  participant B as BFF host
  participant E as Microsoft Entra ID
  participant D as Downstream AI provider

  U->>B: GET /image-regeneration
  B-->>U: 200 shell + /_framework assets (AllowAnonymous)
  W->>W: AuthenticationStateDeserialization — no principal
  W->>U: RedirectToLogin renders /login

  U->>B: GET /challenge-microsoft
  B->>E: OIDC challenge — response_type=code<br/>scope openid profile email
  E-->>U: interactive sign-in
  U->>B: GET /signin-oidc?code=…
  B->>E: code → tokens (SaveTokens = false)
  E-->>B: id_token + claims (GetClaimsFromUserInfoEndpoint)
  B-->>U: Set-Cookie — HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict,<br/>Secure outside Development

  Note over U,W: The cookie is invisible to JS/WASM.<br/>The client only ever sees serialized claims.

  W->>B: fetch /api/… + X-Session-ID + X-Correlation-ID
  B->>B: RequestContextMiddleware — fallbacks,<br/>echo headers, HttpContext.Items
  B->>B: LogContext: CorrelationId · UserId · SessionId
  B->>D: OutboundCorrelationHandler re-stamps both headers<br/>(Ollama · GeminiApi · HuggingFaceApi)
  D-->>B: provider response
  B-->>W: 200 + echoed X-Correlation-ID / X-Session-ID

  alt Session expired
    W->>B: fetch /api/…
    B-->>W: 401 (ApiAwareRedirectToLogin suppresses the 302)
    W->>U: re-render /login
  end
